  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 2632 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methotrexate sodium injection shortage on 2023-03-13 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E29"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing includes Accord Healthcare Inc., Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Hospira Inc. a Pfizer Company, and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc.",
      "cites": ["E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant for Elite Laboratories Inc. (FEI 3002644678) was classified OAI after an inspection that ended 2016-02-02, which was 2632 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E15", "D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant received a Warning Letter on 2016-08-25 and its most recent inspection ended 2025-08-01 with a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant for Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3007938603) was inspected on 2023-03-24 and classified VAI, 11 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E27", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Alembic Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    }
  ]
}
